    return `<span class="mini-label">${head}</span>${summary}${logicLine}${holderLine}<p class="fine-print">Judged locally against the modeled credentials, withdrawals, and signers entered. PRISM read no transaction and no registry: whether a listed withdrawal really executed and whether a listed signer really signed are facts about a real transaction, not judged here — and whether the RegistryNode the redeemer names actually carries this logic credential is judged by the RegistryNode checker below. The paired outputs themselves are judged by the checker above.</p>`;
